('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Kimbo began The Black Road prologue: he identified public claimants connected to missing courier Orren Vey''s coffer, message, and sword, surveyed useful town services, and opened negotiations with tavern keeper Mara Venn.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '0 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo negotiates with Mara Venn over the missing iron-bound coffer: 10 gp to recover it, 5 gp for Orren''s courier ledger, and a promise that Mara will ask her contacts about ways to make Kimbo harder to kill.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '3 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Charisma check: natural 20 (23 total).', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '6 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Mara accepts. Kimbo clarifies he won''t be responsible if the coffer was already opened before he found it — the final deal pays 10 gp for recovery, and Kimbo agrees not to open or damage it himself. Mara accepts and the agreement is sealed.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '9 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Kimbo leaves The Bent Nail and walks to The Crooked Buckle to speak with smith Brannic Coal.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '12 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Brannic shows Kimbo his ordinary arms and armor stock. He sent nothing with Orren Vey and has no property among the missing courier''s packages.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '15 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Kimbo leaves The Crooked Buckle and enters Latch & Ledger. Tamsin Latch reacts with immediate suspicion.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '18 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo wins Tamsin over and offers her first opportunity to inspect and bid on genuinely unclaimed recoveries. She accepts; Kimbo remains free to reject her offers.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '21 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Kimbo leaves Latch & Ledger and enters Reeve''s Hall to investigate the sealed message. Reeve Halric Dain greets him with exceptional warmth.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '24 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo accepts Halric''s offer: 12 gp for the sealed message, temporary chainmail, and town scout Rowan Pike. Kimbo''s AC increases from 11 to 13 while wearing the chainmail and shield. No payment has yet been received.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '27 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Kimbo meets Rowan Pike at Reeve''s Hall. Rowan begins wary and doubtful; the scout has 4 HP, AC 12, a shortbow, dagger, lantern, rope, and field supplies.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '30 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo tells Rowan he seeks protection and wants to repay Dreg''s Ford for giving him a home after he was left for dead. Rowan''s attitude shifts from doubtful to cautious respect.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '33 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Kimbo invites Rowan to accompany him to the Shrine of the Nine. They meet caretaker Aster Vale, who receives them neutrally.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '36 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo pays 5 gp and petitions Madeera. Charisma result: 12.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '39 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Madeera''s Covenant of Return becomes active: once during the recovery expedition, damage that would reduce Kimbo to 0 HP leaves him at 1 HP instead, then the blessing is expended. Kimbo now has 17 gp 5 sp.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '42 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Kimbo thanks Aster and travels with Rowan to Nella Fen''s Remedies. Nella greets him with exceptional concern.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '45 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo gives his word not to abandon Nella''s apprentice while rescue remains reasonably possible.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '48 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Miri Sedge agrees to join for 1 gp per expedition day; she has 4 HP, AC 11, and advantage on stabilization checks. Kimbo also accepts the request to recover three intact ghostleaf sprigs if safely encountered.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '51 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Kimbo, Rowan, and Miri travel to The Bent Nail to recruit Hester Crowe. Hester is available but reacts with immediate hostility.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '54 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo convinces Hester of his desire to atone and repay Dreg''s Ford. Charisma result: 21.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '57 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Hester joins for 3 gp per expedition day. She has 6 HP, AC 14, and can interpose herself against melee attacks targeting close allies.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '60 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Kimbo''s group locates Pell inside The Bent Nail. Pell is heavily intoxicated but coherent and willing to talk if indulged.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '63 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo persuades Pell to give his complete account without payment. Charisma: 22.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '66 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Pell claims Orren was cold, breathless, bloodstained, and speaking in a doubled voice before entering the Black Road. Pell admits trying to rob him and surrenders a torn brass courier button as evidence. The claim remains unverified.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '69 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Miri examines Orren''s button with advantage and scores 13.', 'Miri', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '72 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'She finds dried human blood and a bloodless strip of abnormally dry gray tissue — partial support for Pell''s account without proving the walking-dead claim.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '75 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo buys Pell a drink for 1 sp, leaving 17 gp 4 sp.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '78 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'At the North Palisade Gate, guard Jessa Morn confirms Orren''s strange departure with all cargo.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '81 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Rowan scores 18 examining the old milestone.', 'Rowan', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '84 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'She finds a cut purse-cord fragment plus heel-drag marks leading north, with no struggle or return trail.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '87 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Rowan locates Edda Quill in the Reeve''s Hall records annex. Edda reacts irritably to Kimbo''s group.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '90 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Edda recalls useful history with a result of 13.', 'Edda', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '93 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Orren showed her the Black Hart insignia the day before leaving but kept his employer and recipient confidential. Edda links the extinct order to treason, grave-robbery, and possibly Myre Castle somewhere in the Gloaming; she claims no ownership.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '96 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Edda finds a strong historical match with a lore result of 21.', 'Edda', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '99 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Some Black Hart swords were grave-bound and could allow a dead knight to ride an unauthorized wielder, producing symptoms like those Pell described. Her personal-memory result was only 7 — Orren seemed tired but outwardly normal the prior afternoon and never drew the sword before her.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '102 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo persuades Edda to add free protective-relic research to her pending examination offer. Charisma result: 20.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '105 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'She immediately identifies a lead: the lost Hartguard Gorget, reputed to make stabilization checks easy (DC 9), last associated with Black Hart funerary equipment at Myre Castle.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '108 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo accepts Edda''s contract. She loans him the Black Hart handling kit; her 8 gp examination payment becomes due if he recovers the sword and brings it to her under the agreed conditions.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '111 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Kimbo thanks Edda and returns to Halric. Halric supplies the sealed message''s complete physical identifiers, names Magistrate Elara Voss as its expected sender, and confirms Orren''s intended route ran north from the gate past the old milestone toward a split oak known to Rowan. Territory beyond the milestone remains unexplored by the party.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '114 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo departs Dreg''s Ford with Rowan, Miri, and Hester, beginning the recovery expedition. He pays the first day''s 4 gp wages to Miri and Hester, leaving 13 gp 4 sp.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '117 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Road-event roll to the old milestone: 3 — the party arrives without incident and begins a second search.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '120 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo searches the old milestone with Rowan''s help: 18 after WIS.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '123 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'He recovers a gray waxed-cloth scrap with blue-black wax matching Halric''s description, and traces Orren''s heel-drag marks a short distance north before they turn off the Black Road into the northeast woods — a choice between Orren''s physical trail and his intended route toward the split oak.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '126 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo sends Rowan to scout the trail before the party advances.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '129 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Rowan rolls 20 with advantage and returns unseen.', 'Rowan', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '132 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'She finds a bramble hollow roughly a quarter-mile northeast, thick web strands laid across the direct approach, and a partly concealed human-sized figure moving stiffly beyond a fallen oak. No flanking movement is observed.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '135 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo orders a cautious encirclement before attempting contact.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '138 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Rowan takes the eastern drainage: natural 20 (22 total), reaching an ideal concealed firing position and spotting a large pale spider hidden above the alarm web.', 'Rowan', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '141 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Hester rolls 4 on the western deer run; her shield strikes a stone, alerting the human-shaped figure but not revealing Rowan.', 'Hester', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '144 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'The figure appears to wear Orren''s courier coat and has the wrapped sword beside it.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '147 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo calls Orren by name and asks whether he lost his horse. Orren''s reaction roll: 12.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '150 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'He briefly resists possession, identifies the possessing presence as Sir Aldren Myre, and reveals that the coffer and message are below in an old charcoal pit.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '153 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Rowan wounds the pale spider for 2 damage; it misses Kimbo, and Hester kills it with a 6-damage spear thrust.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '156 minutes'),
