('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Orren''s spirit has not fully departed; it remains tethered through the black needle and sword curse. Aster can conduct a Rite of the Last Ember after sunset, allowing up to three questions answered by Orren''s spirit. The rite cannot resurrect him. Aster asks no coin but requires Kimbo''s promise to pursue Orren''s killer and return his remains for proper burial afterward.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '222 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo gives Aster his word — vowed to make an honest effort to identify Orren''s killer and seek justice, then return Orren''s remains for burial if restoration isn''t possible. The Rite of the Last Ember begins after sunset; three questions are available.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '225 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'First question: Kimbo asks who killed Orren.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '228 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Orren''s spirit accuses Dreg''s Ford courier-master Maela Rusk — her veil slipped as she stabbed him with the hollow black needle, ordering him to "Carry the Hart home." Two questions remain; the accusation is not yet corroborated.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '231 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Second question: Kimbo asks Maela''s motive.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '234 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Orren testifies that Maela believed Magistrate Voss''s message named her as a Black Hart servant. She killed him both to intercept the message and to create a dead vessel that Sir Aldren Myre could use to carry the sword toward Myre Castle. One question remains.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '237 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Final question: Kimbo asks whether Orren wishes to say anything before leaving.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '240 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Orren thanks Kimbo for treating him as a person and trying to save him. He requests burial beside his mother behind the Shrine, warns that Maela may have replaced Voss''s message, and reveals an unsent letter to his sister Lysa hidden behind the ledger''s back cover. Orren''s spirit then passes beyond the sword''s reach.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '243 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Orren''s remains are placed on a consecrated bier in the Shrine''s root-cellar crypt beneath the ash tree beside his mother''s grave. Kimbo receives the sealed burial token.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '246 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'system', 'Kimbo earns 5 XP: 3 XP for recovering the fabulous Black Hart sword, 1 XP for the clever plan that restrained Orren and removed the sword without harming him, and 1 XP for uncovering the major secret of Maela Rusk''s alleged murder and Black Hart allegiance. Kimbo is now at 5/10 XP toward level 2.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '249 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo regroups with Rowan, Miri, and Hester to exchange findings and ask whether they''d continue.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '252 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Rowan''s willingness result: 4 — she remains under town assignment but refuses to return to the pit until Maela is located or contained, unless Kimbo persuades her otherwise.', 'Rowan', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '255 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Miri''s result: 4 on natural snake eyes before modifiers — she''ll help in town but is too shaken to re-enter the spider pit without reassurance or stronger safety preparations.', 'Miri', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '258 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Hester''s result: 8 — she''ll continue under the existing 3 gp per expedition-day terms.', 'Hester', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '261 minutes'),
