('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Nella reserves two antitoxin doses for sunrise for 4 gp. Miri remains with Nella while Kimbo, Rowan, and Hester take the hollow needle and Orren''s written warning to Halric.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '270 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo follows Rowan''s lead before Halric and keeps the spirit testimony private.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '273 minutes'),
