('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Proof that Maela signed out the countermark and Voss seal the evening before Orren died, falsely claiming Halric''s verbal authority. Halric issues a warrant for Maela.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '285 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo removes Lysa Vey''s sealed letter from Orren''s ledger without reading it and hides it safely inside his armor. At Kimbo''s request, Halric authorizes a supervised search of Maela Rusk''s sealed courier office.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '288 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo searches Maela''s office with Rowan''s help: 12.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '291 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'He recovers a burned fragment linking the coffer, message, pit, and the Hart''s journey to Myre; finds a route map marking the bramble hollow and a torn northeast route; and determines from river mud at the rear window that Maela likely escaped through the drainage rather than a gate. A locked iron document box remains unopened under guard.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '294 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Halric summons Tamsin Latch under the warrant. Tamsin rolls 18 and defeats both the box''s lock and hidden needle trap.', 'Tamsin', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '297 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'The box contains Voss''s stolen seal impression, four unused murder needles, dark residue, a key tagged "Venn coffer," and coded Black Hart correspondence.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '300 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Rowan rolls 6 analyzing the route: Myre is plausible but not confirmed, so the updated player map marks the northeast destination only as "M— / Myre?"', 'Rowan', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '303 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Tamsin and Halric''s senior clerk decipher Maela''s ledger from a copy: 19.', 'Tamsin', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '306 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'It identifies Maela as "Rook," directs her to meet "the Ferryman" at Drowned Bell Weir before moonrise if Orren failed, describes Edda as useful but deliberately kept ignorant, calls Halric unsuspecting, describes Venn''s coffer as a tithe, and reveals that Halric''s packet is a substituted dispatch rather than Voss''s true warning.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '309 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo proposes pursuing Maela immediately, then resting and preparing for the spider pit in the morning. Rowan and Hester agree; Halric assigns two town guards at no cost and orders Maela taken alive if reasonably possible. Miri remains safely with Nella.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '312 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Rowan leads the night approach: 13. Event roll: 4.', 'Rowan', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '315 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'The group reaches Drowned Bell Weir without incident and observes Maela meeting a hooded ferryman beside a waiting skiff.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '318 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'The guards roll 11 circling the skiff and alert the suspects before fully closing the flank. Maela and the Ferryman react uncertainly with a 6.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '321 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo uses the encirclement to demand surrender and rolls 22 with advantage.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '324 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Both suspects surrender alive, preserving Maela''s leather packet, hollow needle, skiff, and two loaded packs. Nobody is injured.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '327 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'system', 'Kimbo earns 1 XP for the successful capture and reaches 6/10 XP.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '330 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo confiscates the prisoners'' property and skiff and begins the return to town.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '333 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Event roll: 1 — a river hazard: a submerged chain catches the skiff and sweeps it toward the broken weir.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '336 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Rowan throws a rescue line: 17. Kimbo braces it with a STR result of 19, saving the guard, skiff, packs, and packet.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '339 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'The group returns everything intact to Reeve''s Hall near midnight.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '342 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo sleeps under the Shrine''s protection. Overnight event roll: 6 — nothing interrupts the rest.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '345 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'He wakes at sunrise at 1/1 HP with Madeera''s Covenant of Return still active. Edda''s findings, Mara''s ledger payment, and Nella''s antitoxins are now available; no second-day hireling wages have yet been paid.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '348 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo visits Edda at sunrise.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '351 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Her sword identification result: 19.', 'Edda', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '354 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'The blade is Road''s Memory, and its curse is anchored to Sir Aldren Myre''s bone shard inside the pommel reliquary.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '357 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Her protective-relic research: a natural 20 (23).', 'Edda', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '360 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'The Hartguard Gorget was moved from Myre Castle and hidden in the Bell-Keeper''s Ossuary beneath Drowned Bell Weir, entered by four concealed Hart nails around the bell base. Edda pays Kimbo 8 gp, raising his money to 21 gp 4 sp.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '363 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo delivers Orren''s original courier ledger to Mara after Halric preserves copies of the relevant evidence and Lysa''s personal letter is removed.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '366 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Mara pays the agreed 5 gp, raising Kimbo''s money to 26 gp 4 sp.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '369 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo confronts Mara about the coffer and rolls 22 with advantage.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '372 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Mara confesses that its 40 gp was an annual Black Hart "widow''s tithe" extorted by Maela due to Mara''s late husband''s involvement as a courier. Maela threatened the Bent Nail''s staff. Mara will testify, permits a lawful inventory, and wants the money returned to her payroll after the coffer is recovered.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '375 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo thanks Mara for her honesty, promises to do his best, and goes to Nella.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '378 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'He collects two prepared spider-antitoxin doses for 4 gp, leaving 22 gp 4 sp. Miri recognizes that Kimbo is honoring the requested safety preparations; oil and torches remain to be purchased.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '381 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'On the way to review Maela''s confiscated property, Kimbo buys two oil flasks and two torches from Tamsin for 2 gp, leaving 20 gp 4 sp. Supplies are divided between Kimbo and Miri.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '384 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'system', 'A complete XP audit adds four missed awards: 1 XP for Madeera''s blessing, 1 XP for the substituted-dispatch secret, 1 XP for locating the Hartguard Gorget, and 1 XP for Mara''s Black Hart extortion confession. Kimbo reaches 10/10 XP and may advance to level 2 after his player rolls 1d6 for the Knight HP increase.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '387 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo rolls 4 on his level 2 Knight HP die.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '390 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'His maximum HP increases permanently from 1 to 5, he heals to 5/5 HP through advancement in town, and his XP resets to 0/10. Madeera''s Covenant remains active and unused.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '393 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'action', 'Kimbo reaches Reeve''s Hall for the controlled inventory.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '396 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Tamsin rolls 22 checking the confiscated property and disables a poison needle beneath Maela''s packet clasp.', 'Tamsin', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '399 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'The packet contains Voss''s true opened warning naming Maela and identifying the Ferryman as Dren Tal, believed drowned eight years earlier. Maela''s pack holds a tithe ledger, river map, 9 gp 7 sp, dark reagents, gear, and a dagger. Dren''s pack holds river tools, rope, 15 sp, a bone whistle, Black Hart token, and an unidentified cache key. Everything remains evidence.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '402 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo interrogates Maela by claiming Dren had confessed everything and rolls 20 with advantage.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '405 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Maela admits Orren''s murder, seal theft, false dispatch, tithe extortion, and use of Dren''s spider brood. She implicates "the Castellan," a living Black Hart commander at Myre Castle, and reveals Dren''s bone whistle can command the Bell-Warden once.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '408 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'system', 'Kimbo earns 1 XP for uncovering this major secret.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '411 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo then bluffs Maela with a clamped poison needle and rolls a natural 20 (23 total), asking who left him for dead.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '414 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Maela identifies the Castellan as Captain Varek Skane, Kimbo''s former Black Wake commander, and claims Varek signed Kimbo''s stabbing and marooning order after Kimbo turned against the company. The alleged original is in Dren''s riverside cache.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '417 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'system', 'Kimbo earns 1 XP and reaches 2/10 XP.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '420 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'roll', 'Kimbo confronts Dren with Maela''s disclosures and rolls 21.', 'Kimbo', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '423 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Dren locates his cache beneath the abandoned river customs house''s third stone step, says it contains Varek''s signed order and a route rubbing toward Myre, explains the Bell-Warden whistle''s exact one-use command, and warns that a blind broodmother plus at least two pale spiders remain in the charcoal pit. Halric records the cooperation without promising immunity.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '426 minutes'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'e00ceebd-c2e7-472e-bc6e-feec654ab2a6', '6b54f8ea-e47a-421a-8538-e65962b0d2ae', 'narration', 'Dren tells Kimbo that Varek is a living Castellan who needs Road''s Memory and the Hartguard Gorget to awaken the knights buried beneath Myre Castle. He says Varek condemned Kimbo for stopping the execution of surrendered prisoners at Red Shoal. Varek has a clouded left eye and badly burned, weak left hand, and likely doesn''t yet know Kimbo survived.', 'GM', timestamptz '2026-08-02 18:00:00+00' + interval '429 minutes');
insert into characters (campaign_id, member_id, name, class_title, background, alignment_title, level, xp_current, xp_needed, hp_current, hp_max, ac, gear_current, gear_max, gold, abilities, sheet, status)
values
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'a4d4fe17-be85-459d-ada2-a61b12e0446c', 'Kimbo Slice', 'Human Knight of St. Ydris', 'Marooned', 'Chaotic Traitor', 2, 2, 10, 5, 5, 13, 8, 15, '{"gp": 20, "sp": 4, "cp": 0}'::jsonb, '{"str": {"score": 15, "mod": 2}, "dex": {"score": 6, "mod": -2}, "con": {"score": 6, "mod": -2}, "int": {"score": 12, "mod": 1}, "wis": {"score": 8, "mod": -1}, "cha": {"score": 16, "mod": 3}}'::jsonb, '{"attacks_talents": ["Bastard sword +4, 1d8+2 damage one-handed.", "Human extra talent and Knight talent: +2 total to melee and ranged attack rolls.", "Demonic Possession 3/day: +1 damage for 3 rounds.", "No spells until level 3."], "active_blessing": "Madeera''s Covenant of Return: once during the current recovery expedition, when damage would reduce Kimbo to 0 HP, he remains at 1 HP instead. Then the blessing is expended. Offering paid: 5 gp.", "covenant_duties": ["Do not open Halric''s message", "Return property when ownership is reasonably established", "Truthfully report where and how recovered objects were found"], "equipment": ["Equipped: loaned chainmail, shield, bastard sword.", "Mission property: chainmail belonging to Dreg''s Ford; return after the official sealed-message recovery mission.", "Stored: personal leather armor.", "Crawling kit: backpack, flint and steel, 2 torches, 3 rations, 10 iron spikes, grappling hook, 60 feet of rope.", "Crowbar.", "Evidence (no slot): brass courier button torn from Orren Vey''s coat.", "Evidence (no slot): copies of Orren''s ledger pages, hidden warning note, wax scrap, wrapped needle fragments.", "One dose of Nella''s spider antitoxin; the second assigned to Miri.", "2 oil flasks and 2 torches, divided between Kimbo and Miri."], "languages": ["Common", "Goblin", "Diabolic"], "appearance": "Huge and muscular; teal-green eyes; two-toned white-and-red beard; Viking warrior haircut; tattoo-covered body. Wears battered black gothic leather armor over visible wounds and bandages. Carries a bastard sword and black shield.", "personal_revelation": "Maela Rusk claims the Black Hart Castellan is Captain Varek Skane, Kimbo''s former commander in the Black Wake. She handled an order signed V.S. declaring Kimbo a traitor and directing the crew to stab him and maroon him. Dren''s riverside cache allegedly contains the original order."}'::jsonb, 'active'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'a4d4fe17-be85-459d-ada2-a61b12e0446c', 'Constantine', 'Human Priest of Ord', 'Woodborn', 'Neutral Seeker', 1, 0, 10, 2, 2, 10, 4, 17, '{"gp": 1, "sp": 0, "cp": 0}'::jsonb, '{"str": {"score": 17, "mod": 3}, "dex": {"score": 5, "mod": -3}, "con": {"score": 8, "mod": -1}, "int": {"score": 6, "mod": -2}, "wis": {"score": 9, "mod": -1}, "cha": {"score": 13, "mod": 1}}'::jsonb, '{"attacks_talents": ["Mace +5, 1d6+3 damage.", "Staff +5, 1d4+3 damage; two-handed.", "Human extra talent and Priest talent: +2 total to melee and ranged attack rolls.", "Priest spellcasting -1."], "spells": ["Cure Wounds", "Shield of Faith", "Turn Undead"], "equipment": ["Equipped for combat: leather armor, shield, mace.", "Carried: constellation staff, backpack, flint and steel, torch, 3 rations.", "Holy symbol of Ord: the constellation of beauty marks on her face; no slot."], "languages": ["Common", "Elvish", "Primordial"], "appearance": "Fifty-year-old woman with a buzz cut, blue-green eyes, medium build, and a constellation of beauty marks across her face. Wears green-and-gold crystalline vestments. Carries a dark ancient-wood staff carved with constellations."}'::jsonb, 'awaiting'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'a4d4fe17-be85-459d-ada2-a61b12e0446c', 'LaLa', 'Human Witch', 'Sailor (Pirate)', 'Chaotic Whisperer', 1, 0, 10, 4, 4, 12, 10, 10, '{"gp": 16, "sp": 0, "cp": 0}'::jsonb, '{"str": {"score": 10, "mod": 0}, "dex": {"score": 12, "mod": 1}, "con": {"score": 13, "mod": 1}, "int": {"score": 11, "mod": 0}, "wis": {"score": 13, "mod": 1}, "cha": {"score": 13, "mod": 1}}'::jsonb, '{"attacks_talents": ["Dagger +1, 1d4 damage; finesse and thrown.", "Human extra talent and Witch talent: +4 Charisma total, already included above.", "Witch spellcasting +1."], "spells": ["Eyebite", "Hypnotize", "Shadowdance"], "familiar": "Spaci: adorable realistic black cat; loyal; speaks Common; may serve as LaLa''s point of origin for spell ranges.", "equipment": ["Equipped: leather armor, dagger.", "Crawling kit: backpack, flint and steel, 2 torches, 3 rations, 10 iron spikes, grappling hook, 60 feet of rope.", "Lantern and 2 oil flasks."], "languages": ["Common", "Merran", "Diabolic", "Primordial", "Sylvan"], "appearance": "Beautiful young witch with long purple hair, bright blue eyes, elegant purple pirate-influenced clothing, and a large purple witch hat. Spaci walks at her side."}'::jsonb, 'awaiting');
insert into npcs (campaign_id, name, role, location, attitude, status, is_hireling, hire_terms, stat_block, summary)
values
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Mara Venn', 'Tavern keeper of The Bent Nail', 'The Bent Nail, Dreg''s Ford', 'Curious', 'alive', false, null, null, 'Says the missing iron-bound coffer belongs to her. Agreed to pay Kimbo 10 gp for recovering it and 5 gp for Orren''s courier ledger (paid). Confessed under Kimbo''s Charisma 22 that the coffer holds a 40 gp Black Hart "widow''s tithe" extorted annually by Maela because her late husband Toman once carried messages for the order; Maela threatened her staff. Will testify against Maela and permits Halric to inventory the coffer before its return.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Orren Vey', 'Professional road courier', 'Shrine of the Nine (remains, root-cellar crypt)', null, 'deceased', false, null, null, 'Missing courier carrying an iron-bound coffer, sealed message, and a sword bearing the Order of the Black Hart''s insignia. Body recovered; murdered five days prior by a blood-draining hollow needle, then used as Sir Aldren Myre''s vessel. During the Rite of the Last Ember he named his killer as Maela Rusk, explained her motive, requested burial beside his mother, and revealed a hidden letter for his sister Lysa Vey. His spirit has passed beyond the sword''s reach.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Halric Dain', 'Reeve of Dreg''s Ford', 'Reeve''s Hall', 'Exceptionally helpful on first meeting', 'alive', false, null, null, 'Claims the sealed message belongs to his office. Agreement with Kimbo: 12 gp for recovering it, plus temporary chainmail and scout Rowan Pike (Kimbo must not open the message himself). Message was sent by Magistrate Elara Voss; gray waxed-cloth packet, black cord, blue-black raven-and-broken-crown seal, countermark FEN-7. Issued a lawful warrant for Maela Rusk after the FEN-7 register proved she signed it out under a false claim of his authority.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Rowan Pike', 'Town scout and pathfinder under Reeve Halric Dain', 'Dreg''s Ford', 'Cautious but respectful', 'alive', true, 'Wage paid by Dreg''s Ford (town-assigned, not Kimbo''s coin). Retains personal judgment and will not obey suicidal orders.', '{"hp_current": 4, "hp_max": 4, "ac": 12, "attacks": ["Shortbow +2 (1d4)", "Dagger +2 (1d4)"]}'::jsonb, 'Assigned to accompany Kimbo on the official recovery of Halric''s sealed message. Skilled at trail signs, navigation, and moving quietly. After the spider-pit encounter, remains under town assignment but refuses to return to the pit until Maela is located or contained unless Kimbo persuades her otherwise.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Aster Vale', 'Caretaker and lay attendant at the Shrine of the Nine', 'Shrine of the Nine, Dreg''s Ford', 'Neutral and attentive on first meeting', 'alive', false, null, null, 'Receives petitions, offerings, oaths, and healing/blessing requests for the shrine. Authorized the Rite of the Last Ember (result 22) after Kimbo vowed to pursue Orren''s killer and return his remains for burial.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Edda Quill', 'Local historian', 'Dreg''s Ford (records annex, Reeve''s Hall)', 'Reacted irritably on first meeting', 'alive', false, null, null, 'Identified the sword''s insignia as the extinct Order of the Black Hart. Accepted contract: 8 gp to examine the recovered sword (paid), loan of a Black Hart handling kit, identification and curse research, and free protective-relic research after Kimbo''s Charisma 20. Identified the sword as Road''s Memory, cursed via Sir Aldren Myre''s bone shard in the pommel reliquary, and located the Hartguard Gorget lead in the Bell-Keeper''s Ossuary beneath Drowned Bell Weir (natural 20/23 result).'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Maela Rusk', 'Courier-master of Dreg''s Ford', 'Captured — town custody', null, 'captured', false, null, null, 'Orren''s spirit identified her as his killer — stabbed him with a hollow black needle to intercept Voss''s message exposing her as a Black Hart servant, and to create a vessel for Sir Aldren Myre. Fled after the murder; the FEN-7 register and a trapped document box corroborated the accusation. Captured alive at Drowned Bell Weir (Kimbo''s Charisma 22) attempting to meet "the Ferryman." Confessed under bluffs (CHA 20, then a natural 20/23): admitted the murder, seal theft, dispatch substitution, tithe extortion, and named "the Castellan" — Captain Varek Skane, Kimbo''s former commander — as the one who ordered Kimbo marooned.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Dren Tal', 'The Black Hart agent called "the Ferryman"; formerly a licensed river guide, officially believed drowned eight years ago', 'Captured — town custody, held separately from Maela', null, 'captured', false, null, null, 'Captured alive with Maela at Drowned Bell Weir. Cooperated (Kimbo''s result 21, no immunity promised): identified his riverside cache beneath the third stone step of the abandoned river customs house, explained the Bell-Warden bone-whistle command, and warned of a blind broodmother plus at least two pale spiders in the charcoal pit. Confirmed Varek Skane is living, not undead, and seeks Road''s Memory and the Hartguard Gorget to awaken the Black Hart knights buried beneath Myre Castle.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Captain Varek Skane', 'Former captain of the Black Wake; alleged living Castellan of the restored Black Hart at Myre Castle', 'Myre Castle (unconfirmed)', 'Not yet met', 'alive', false, null, null, 'Kimbo''s former commander. Per Dren, condemned Kimbo after Kimbo refused to help kill surrendered prisoners at Red Shoal and struck Varek to stop it; Maela says Varek signed the order to stab and maroon Kimbo. Tall, broad, black plate with a silver-split stag, clouded left eye, badly burned weak left hand. Seeks Road''s Memory and the Hartguard Gorget for a rite to awaken the Black Hart knights buried beneath Myre Castle. Dren believes he doesn''t yet know Kimbo survived.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Pell', 'Grave-robber', 'Usually around The Bent Nail', 'Neutral and willing to talk if indulged', 'alive', false, null, null, 'Claimed Orren was already dead — cold, breathless, bloodstained, speaking in a doubled voice — before entering the Black Road. Admitted trying to rob Orren and surrendered a torn brass courier button as evidence (partially corroborated by Miri''s examination). Bought a drink for 1 sp after questioning; unverified beyond the partial corroboration.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Jessa Morn', 'North Palisade gate guard', 'North Palisade Gate, Dreg''s Ford', 'Neutral and cooperative', 'alive', false, null, null, 'Held the night watch when Orren departed. Confirmed he presented a valid courier badge, carried all known cargo, moved stiffly, didn''t answer her greeting, and caused the gate dog to whine and retreat. No one else used the gate within the following hour.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Nella Fen', 'Herbalist and healer', 'Nella Fen''s Remedies', 'Exceptionally helpful and immediately concerned on first meeting', 'alive', false, null, null, 'Provides medical supplies and recommended apprentice healer Miri Sedge, in exchange for Kimbo''s promise not to abandon Miri and to recover ghostleaf. Prepared two spider-antitoxin doses for 4 gp (collected).'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Miri Sedge', 'Apprentice field healer under Nella Fen', 'Nella Fen''s Remedies, Dreg''s Ford', 'Receptive but evaluating him carefully', 'alive', true, '1 gp per expedition day, no required treasure share; Kimbo vowed not to abandon her while rescue remains reasonably possible. First day paid.', '{"hp_current": 4, "hp_max": 4, "ac": 11, "attacks": ["Dagger +0 (1d4)"], "notes": "Stabilization checks with advantage."}'::jsonb, 'Agreed to accompany Kimbo and Rowan; will collect three intact ghostleaf sprigs if safely encountered. After the spider-pit encounter, will help in town but is currently too shaken to return to the pit without reassurance or stronger safety preparations (two antitoxins, fire for the webs, a secured rope descent, a disciplined formation, and a mandatory retreat plan).'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Tobin Reed', 'Porter, lamplighter, and expedition hand', 'Usually works near the River Gate; not yet met', null, 'alive', true, 'Expected rate 1 gp per expedition day. Recommended by Miri Sedge; availability and reaction not yet determined.', null, 'Potential recruit — carries expedition gear, manages torches and lanterns, packs camps, avoids combat. Not yet recruited.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Hester Crowe', 'Veteran caravan guard', 'Usually found at The Bent Nail', 'Respectful but watchful, after Kimbo convinced her he''s trying to atone (CHA 21 vs DC 15)', 'alive', true, '3 gp per expedition day, paid at departure for each day; no required treasure share; retains personal judgment and refuses suicidal orders.', '{"hp_current": 6, "hp_max": 6, "ac": 14, "attacks": ["Spear +3 (1d6)"], "notes": "Once per round before a melee attack is rolled against a close ally, may interpose and become the target instead."}'::jsonb, 'Recruited veteran guard. Willing to continue under the existing terms after the spider-pit encounter (result 8).'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Brannic Coal', 'Smith', 'The Crooked Buckle', 'Businesslike and neutral', 'alive', false, null, null, 'Sells and repairs mundane weapons and armor (leather 10 gp, chainmail 60 gp, plate by order 130 gp, shields 10 gp). Sent nothing with Orren Vey and claims no recovery fee or property.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Tamsin Latch', 'Locksmith, appraiser, and recovery broker', 'Latch & Ledger', 'Cautiously favorable — views Kimbo as a potential preferred client', 'alive', false, null, null, 'Opens, identifies, and assesses recovered mundane property; gets first opportunity to inspect and bid on Kimbo''s genuinely unclaimed recoveries (no obligation to accept). Opened Maela''s trapped document box (18) and later the confiscated-property inventory (22, disabling a poison needle) under Halric''s warrant, town paying her fee.');
insert into factions (campaign_id, name, type, leader, territory, goal, disposition, status, notes)
values
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Dreg''s Ford Reeve''s Office', 'Civic authority', 'Halric Dain', 'Dreg''s Ford', 'Recover the sealed message; uphold law in town', 'Allied — sponsoring Kimbo''s recovery mission', 'Active investigation into Maela Rusk', 'Issued a lawful warrant for Maela Rusk after the FEN-7 register corroborated Orren''s spirit testimony. Ownership and intended recipient of the sealed message remain unconfirmed pending Voss verification.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Order of the Black Hart', 'Extinct knightly order (apparently restored)', 'Captain Varek Skane (alleged, as "the Castellan")', 'Myre Castle, the Gloaming (unconfirmed location)', 'Recover Road''s Memory and the Hartguard Gorget to awaken the Black Hart knights buried beneath Myre Castle', 'Hostile — murdered Orren Vey, extorted Mara Venn, marooned Kimbo', 'Active threat — Maela Rusk ("Rook") and Dren Tal ("the Ferryman") captured; Varek Skane''s location and full strength unconfirmed', 'Vanished over a century ago amid accusations of treason and grave-robbery (per Edda Quill). Orren carried a sword bearing its insignia.');
insert into quests (campaign_id, code, title, status, claimant, goal, summary, sort_order)
values
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Q-001', 'The Black Road', 'Active', null, 'Hire help, investigate Orren Vey''s disappearance, recover treasure, and return alive.', 'Where the road leads, what lives there, and Orren''s fate were all unknown at the outset. Pell''s account (unverified at first) placed Orren already dead-seeming near the North Palisade Gate before dawn. Miri''s examination of a torn courier button, Jessa Morn''s gate-watch account, and Rowan''s milestone search all partially corroborated Pell. The trail led to a bramble hollow, a charcoal pit, and ultimately to Orren''s body and the revelation of Maela Rusk and the Order of the Black Hart.', 1),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Q-002', 'The Iron-Bound Coffer', 'Accepted', 'Mara Venn', 'Recover Mara Venn''s coffer without opening or damaging it.', 'Agreed payment: 10 gp for recovering the coffer; +5 gp for Orren''s ledger (paid). Kimbo will not open or deliberately damage the coffer, but isn''t responsible if it was already open before recovery. Mara confessed (Kimbo''s CHA 22) that the coffer holds a 40 gp Black Hart "widow''s tithe" extorted annually by Maela; her late husband Toman once carried messages for the order. Mara will testify against Maela and permits Halric to inventory the coffer before its return. The coffer itself remains unrecovered in the charcoal pit. Next: recover the coffer and return it to Mara.', 2),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Q-003', 'The Sealed Message', 'Accepted', 'Reeve Halric Dain', 'Identify owner and intended recipient, then negotiate a recovery fee.', 'Agreed payment: 12 gp for recovering and returning the sealed message; Kimbo must not open it himself. Message identifiers: palm-length gray waxed-cloth packet, black cord, blue-black wax seal (hooded raven on a broken crown), addressed to Halric Dain, courier countermark FEN-7. Expected sender: Magistrate Elara Voss. The trail led through the milestone, the bramble hollow, and Orren himself (controlled by Sir Aldren Myre via the Black Hart sword) to the revelation that Maela Rusk murdered Orren, stole Voss''s seal, and substituted a false dispatch for Halric. Maela and her accomplice Dren Tal ("the Ferryman") were captured at Drowned Bell Weir; Voss''s true opened warning was recovered from Maela''s trapped packet, naming her as compromised and identifying Dren. Maela confessed to the murder, seal theft, dispatch substitution, tithe extortion, and coordinating Dren''s spider brood; she implicated a living Black Hart commander, "the Castellan" (alleged to be Captain Varek Skane, Kimbo''s former commander), at Myre Castle. The sealed message itself remains unrecovered in the charcoal pit. Still open: verify the recovered dispatch directly with Magistrate Voss; determine Myre Castle''s location; complete Halric''s prosecution.', 3),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Q-004', 'The Black Hart Sword', 'Lead', 'Edda Quill', 'Determine lawful ownership and negotiate a recovery or examination fee.', 'Edda identified the sword''s insignia (black stag split by a silver line) as the extinct Order of the Black Hart, which vanished over a century ago amid accusations of treason and grave-robbery, possibly associated with Myre Castle. Edda''s contract (accepted): 8 gp for examination (paid), loan of a Black Hart handling kit, identification and curse research, and testimony supporting a salvage petition if no lawful owner is found — in exchange for preserving the sword and wrappings, not drawing or wielding it, and returning the kit. Identification complete (result 19): the sword is named Road''s Memory, its curse anchored to a bone shard of Sir Aldren Myre sealed inside the pommel reliquary — the presence that rode Orren. The curse could potentially be exorcised under consecrated containment; breaking or drawing the sword remains dangerous. Edda''s added concession (after CHA 20) led to the Hartguard Gorget lead: hidden in the Bell-Keeper''s Ossuary beneath Drowned Bell Weir (natural 20/23), entered via four concealed Hart nails around the bell base — current guardians and condition unknown.', 4),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Q-005', 'A Harder Man to Kill', 'Personal', null, 'Gain XP, levels, armor, rare aid, or blessings before the family campaign.', 'Normal healing cannot raise Kimbo above 1 maximum HP without leveling. Mara Venn agreed to investigate protective equipment, charms, and blessings through her contacts. Tamsin Latch has no protective magic in stock and recommends the Shrine of the Nine. Active protection: Madeera''s Covenant of Return (once during the current expedition, lethal damage leaves Kimbo at 1 HP instead; then the blessing ends). Offering paid: 5 gp. Kimbo has since leveled to 2 (5/5 HP) through the XP audit and the Knight''s level-up HP roll.', 5),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Q-006', 'Ghostleaf for Nella', 'Accepted; complete if safely possible', 'Nella Fen', 'Return at least three intact ghostleaf sprigs with roots for Nella Fen.', 'Support gained: Miri Sedge joins as an apprentice field healer for 1 gp per expedition day and can attempt stabilization with advantage. Kimbo swore not to abandon Miri while a reasonable chance of bringing her home remains. Whether ghostleaf will be encountered along the expedition route is still unknown.', 6),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Q-007', 'Additional Expedition Help', 'Hester recruited; Tobin remains a lead', null, 'Recruit additional expedition support.', 'Tobin Reed: porter and lamplighter recommended by Miri; expected rate 1 gp/day; usually near River Gate; availability and reaction not yet determined. Hester Crowe: recruited veteran guard, 6/6 HP, AC 14, spear +3 (1d6), 3 gp/day; can interpose against a melee attack targeting a close ally.', 7);
insert into treasure (campaign_id, name, category, quantity_value, held_by, location, status, notes)
values
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Kimbo''s coin', 'Currency', '20 gp 4 sp', 'Kimbo Slice', null, 'held', 'Current total after all Session 1 transactions.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Constantine''s coin', 'Currency', '1 gp', 'Constantine', null, 'held', 'Personal funds; not in current play.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'LaLa''s coin', 'Currency', '16 gp', 'LaLa', null, 'held', 'Personal funds; not in current play.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Road''s Memory (Black Hart sword)', 'Relic weapon', '1', 'Edda Quill', 'Warded iron chest, Reeve''s Hall', 'contained', 'Cursed — anchored to Sir Aldren Myre''s bone shard sealed inside the pommel reliquary. Do not draw, wield, break, or casually open the reliquary. Varek Skane wants it recovered.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Hartguard Gorget', 'Relic', '1', null, 'Bell-Keeper''s Ossuary beneath Drowned Bell Weir (behind four concealed Hart nails)', 'lead-only, unrecovered', 'Reputed to make stabilization checks on its dying wearer easy (DC 9 instead of DC 15).'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'The Iron-Bound Coffer (Mara Venn''s)', 'Container', '1', null, 'Charcoal pit beneath the bramble hollow', 'pending recovery', 'Contains a 40 gp Black Hart "widow''s tithe" per Mara''s confession. Owed to Mara on recovery (10 gp recovery fee already agreed).'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'The Sealed Message (Halric''s)', 'Document', '1', null, 'Charcoal pit beneath the bramble hollow', 'pending recovery', 'Gray waxed-cloth packet from Magistrate Elara Voss, blue-black wax seal, countermark FEN-7. 12 gp owed to Halric on recovery.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Maela Rusk''s confiscated packet and pack', 'Evidence', '1 packet, 1 pack', 'Reeve''s Hall (evidence)', null, 'secured', 'Packet held Voss''s true opened warning naming Maela and identifying Dren Tal. Pack held a Black Hart tithe ledger, river-route map, 9 gp 7 sp, two dark-reagent vials, travel gear, and a dagger.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Dren Tal''s confiscated pack', 'Evidence', '1 pack', 'Reeve''s Hall (evidence)', null, 'secured', 'River tools, rope, 15 sp, a bone whistle (commands the Bell-Warden once), a Black Hart token, and a key to Dren''s riverside cache.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Dren''s riverside cache', 'Lead', 'unknown', null, 'Beneath the third stone step of the abandoned river customs house, downstream from Drowned Bell Weir', 'lead-only, unrecovered', 'Allegedly contains Captain Varek Skane''s signed order against Kimbo, a route rubbing toward Myre, and Dren''s reserve money. Trap warning: turning the key normally collapses the step into the river.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Orren Vey''s sealed burial token', 'Document', '1', 'Kimbo Slice', null, 'held', 'Received from the Shrine of the Nine after Orren''s remains were placed on the consecrated bier. To be used when the investigation concludes and Orren is buried beside his mother.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Lysa Vey''s sealed letter', 'Document', '1', 'Kimbo Slice', 'Hidden inside Kimbo''s armor lining', 'held, unopened', 'Orren''s final unsent letter to his sister, recovered from behind his courier ledger''s back cover. Not yet delivered.'),
('d20f78a5-20c7-4d27-9d47-b3d8c075b128', 'Black Hart handling kit', 'Gear', '1 slot', 'Kimbo Slice', null, 'on loan from Edda Quill', 'Grants advantage on checks to secure or transport Road''s Memory without drawing or touching it. To be returned to Edda.');
insert into campaign_events (campaign_id, actor, kind, payload)
